# trước is "before" and "ago", trailing the duration it counts back over
# ("ba ngày trước").  cách đây is the dedicated "ago" adverb and PRECEDES
# the duration ("cách đây ba ngày"); both orders are declared, so the
# marker's side of the count is a property of the word, not of the locale.
# en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tr%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc and https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/c%C3%A1ch%20%C4%91%C3%A2y.
trước
cách đây
